# Record the README GIF with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs:  vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1400
Set Height 820
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "canopy" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "2" Sleep 1s
Down Sleep 500ms
Enter Sleep 1s
Down Sleep 400ms
Space Sleep 1s
Escape Sleep 500ms
Type "c" Sleep 500ms
Type "Add greeting" Sleep 800ms
Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type "3" Sleep 2s
Type ":" Sleep 500ms
Type "push" Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Type "?" Sleep 2s
Escape
Type "q"
